OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment approves Peterborough
OL,4,ASEND reform plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to improve provision for children
OL,7,Fwith special educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities (SEND) in Peterborough
OL,9,Fhave moved a step closer after the
OL,10,Fgovernment approved the council's
OL,11,Fproposals.
OL,13,FPeterborough City Council submitted its
OL,14,FLocal SEND Reform Plan to the
OL,15,FDepartment for Education earlier this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe council said approval meant it was
OL,19,Feligible for a #9.8m grant.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
